{"id":1008,"slug":"maid-bell","name":"Bell","title":"Candle Square","call_name":"Bell","description":"The second daughter of House Rhys and caretaker of the NOA cemetery. A hexcaster who serves at Candle Square to fulfill her family's duty in place of her missing elder sister.","introduction":"The second daughter of House Rhys, a self-proclaimed hexcaster, and caretaker of the NOA Cemetery managed by the Rhys estate.\nBell is currently serving as a maid in Candle Square to fulfill House Rhys's oath, the <color=#2A80D8>Firstborn's Duty</color>, in place of her missing older sister Carnelia Rhys.\n\nCynical and cold, her words and actions make it seem as if she values the dead more than the living, so those around her consider her a <color=#2A80D8>willful brat</color> and avoid her like the plague. She is well aware of this, but does not particularly care.\n\nBell takes a special interest in the tombstones that adorn the cemetery, and whenever she gets the chance, she secretly uses both her own money and Candle Square's funds to buy and stockpile stone materials for gravestones.","grade":"SSR","attribute":"Star","role":"Ranger","sub_role":"Capricorn","attack_type":"Spirit","observe_type":"Normal","birthday":"2 / 29","height":"156 cm","hometown":"NOA","affiliation":"Candle Square","voice_actor_kr":"Lee Ji-hyeon","voice_actor_jp":"Chisa Suganuma","images":{"icon":"/images/icons/UFS_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_BELL.webp","portrait":"/images/portraits/UF_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_BELL.webp","illust":"/images/illusts/NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_BELL_ILLUST.webp","arcpoint":"/images/arcpoints/T_ARCPOINT_S_MAID_BELL_1.webp","arcpoint_hd":"/images/arcpoints_hd/ARCPOINT_S_MAID_BELL.webp","journey_bgs":["/images/journey_bg/ILLUST_BG_JOURNEY_MAID_BELL_01.webp","/images/journey_bg/ILLUST_BG_JOURNEY_MAID_BELL_02.webp"]},"base_stats":{"HP":1380,"SPD":100,"Toughness":3,"ATK":240,"DEF":15,"ACC":100,"CRIT Rate":5,"CRIT DMG":50,"Effect Hit":100,"Effect RES":0,"Guaranteed Effect Hit":0,"Guaranteed Effect RES":20,"Attrib